# Dev-only (loaded by `npm run dev`): route API calls under /api so they never
# collide with the SPA routes (/config, /metrics, /audit, /operators, …). The
# Vite dev proxy (vite.config.ts) forwards /api → 127.0.0.1:8000, stripping /api.
# Production leaves VITE_API_BASE empty and is served behind a reverse proxy (§12).
# Tests/e2e run with VITE_API_BASE="" and a mocked API, so they're unaffected.
VITE_API_BASE=/api
